","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5TQ47"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aea7775f-e31a-40dd-af77-16ce1e79c10e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"っていうかEKSも普通に時間xインスタンス(?)数じゃなかったっけ?","ts":"1622188151.066000","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1622188161.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tsoLE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f901d4c-951f-4d49-af35-5a70658a97c1","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"k8sするならそれ用のAWSのサービス使った方が良いかなと思います。詳しくないですが。","ts":"1622188148.065700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I3d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc6c857f-2974-4649-aacb-d5f5124b387d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"めんどいけど自分でEC2複数インスタンス立てればk8sの費用固定運用ってできることになるのかね?","ts":"1622188110.064900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0pt="}]},{"client_msg_id":"df4eb794-b244-453e-8ca2-494cd92db60e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"EBSも割り当てた以上に自動アロケーションはされないし。","ts":"1622188076.064300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=XrYj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81ab0fa7-acda-41e5-ba65-c7badee6ecbc","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"インスタンス決めちゃえば月額固定でしょ?","ts":"1622188051.063900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C2b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa2f999c-5fed-4541-aaa7-77d63d287dc0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あれ? 若干高くなるかもだけどEC2ならそれで良いのでは?","ts":"1622188037.063600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jgk6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eda0753b-1be2-4a4b-8eb2-29804f146717","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"自分の環境なんて、8割検証目的なので。","ts":"162